From 7cbb716d50b03f5a59cf445a7ce8f021c6d6c4ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gezim <gezimos@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 18:23:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 098/101] Kompakt: no black frame going home

Going home from an opaque app, WM Shell starts the transition with every
opening change at alpha 0, the wallpaper included, and DefaultTransitionHandler
never animates the wallpaper: only the finish transaction shows it again. With
the animation scale at 0 the launcher\x27s zero-length animation applies its end
state at once, but the finish only comes after the animator ends on the next
vsync. For that frame the launcher stood over a hidden wallpaper, which e-ink
painted as a black flash (recorded on 328, inkOS from Phone). With animations
off the handler now merges the finish transaction into the start transaction
and finishes at once, so the end state lands in one frame.

Change-Id: I7a7c782cea7d97c7b1b825d3cf9c54b1e5be5a7e
---
 .../wm/shell/transition/DefaultTransitionHandler.java      | 7 ++++++-
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/libs/WindowManager/Shell/src/com/android/wm/shell/transition/DefaultTransitionHandler.java b/libs/WindowManager/Shell/src/com/android/wm/shell/transition/DefaultTransitionHandler.java
index 9daeed72cfdb..1851f8adb31d 100644
--- a/libs/WindowManager/Shell/src/com/android/wm/shell/transition/DefaultTransitionHandler.java
+++ b/libs/WindowManager/Shell/src/com/android/wm/shell/transition/DefaultTransitionHandler.java
@@ -347,10 +347,15 @@ public class DefaultTransitionHandler implements Transitions.TransitionHandler {
             return true;
         }
 
+        // Kompakt: with animations off, jump to the end state in one transaction; a zero-length
+        // animation lands a frame before the finish shows the wallpaper again, a black frame on home.
+        final boolean kompaktJumpCut = mTransitionAnimationScaleSetting == 0f;
         // Early check if the transition doesn't warrant an animation.
-        if (isAnimationsDisabledForAnyDisplay(info) || TransitionUtil.isAllNoAnimation(info)
+        if (kompaktJumpCut || isAnimationsDisabledForAnyDisplay(info)
+                || TransitionUtil.isAllNoAnimation(info)
                 || TransitionUtil.isAllOrderOnly(info)
                 || (info.getFlags() & WindowManager.TRANSIT_FLAG_INVISIBLE) != 0) {
+            if (kompaktJumpCut) startTransaction.merge(finishTransaction);
             startTransaction.apply();
             // As a contract, finishTransaction should only be applied in Transitions#onFinish
             finishCallback.onTransitionFinished(null /* wct */);
